==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Runner-Up #2's Japanese name, Dame Nan Desu Ka 2-i, is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/zWH87FnnVMs 2-i ja dame nande shōka]", half of a controversial quote from Japanese politician [[wikipedia:Renhō|Renhō Saitō]]. The full quote roughly meant "Why do we have to be the best in the world? Can't we settle for second place?"

